      },
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Zashathal gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, he deals 12 additional damage with melee attacks and takes a –1 penalty to AC. Zashathal can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies Zashathal can perceive, or until Zashathal falls unconscious. Once the rage ends, Zashathal can't Rage again for 1 minute."
      ],
